From: ruje0504-2
Subject: [LOCAL DIAGNOSTIC] t214: signal the final PSCI power boundary

Apply after 0003. Disabled unless SWITCH_LITE_POWER_TRACE=1.

--- a/plat/nvidia/tegra/soc/t210/platform_t210.mk
+++ b/plat/nvidia/tegra/soc/t210/platform_t210.mk
@@ -4,6 +4,12 @@
